      "finding": "Label sets and outcome values are underspecified.",
      "evidence": "S4 defines outcome as success or failure only. S5 defines no histogram labels. The lane label set is not enumerated, so cardinality is unbounded. Cancelled, rejected or retried jobs have no outcome."
