{
  "key": "DP-24",
  "title": "Move navigation from a top bar to a left sidebar",
  "body": "The top bar feels wrong for the retheme's HUD aesthetic. Owner wants a left sidebar instead.\n\nMainNav moves from a top bar to a persistent left sidebar, full labels always visible (no icon-only collapse, no drawer), narrower on mobile than desktop. The active route gets a glowing highlight, which requires MainNav to become a Client Component. The layout flips from flex-col to flex-row in app/layout.tsx. No route, testid or behavior changes.",
  "type_hint": null,
  "status": "open",
  "url": "https://example.invalid/DP-24",
  "source": "local-markdown",
  "labels": [],
  "links": []
}

Its triage artifact:

